@host = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = local-development-key-change-me

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Dynamic feedback. In Development, creates data/mail/*.eml.
POST {{host}}/api/feedback
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "ReportABug",
  "comments": "The dashboard does not refresh after saving.\nPlease investigate.",
  "submittedBy": "vamsi@example.com",
  "hardwareId": "DEVICE-001",
  "attachments": [
    { "fileName": "details.txt", "content": "SGVsbG8gZnJvbSBmZWVkYmFjayE=" }
  ]
}

### Preview only. No message is sent or saved.
POST {{host}}/api/feedback/preview
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "GeneralFeedback",
  "comments": "The new dashboard is easy to use.",
  "submittedBy": "another-user@example.com",
  "hardwareId": "DEVICE-002"
}
